Emerging Market Opportunities
Long-acting engineered peptides and improved delivery systems offer opportunities to enhance treatment convenience and product differentiation. Oral peptide medicines may also expand access in therapeutic areas where injectable administration presents practical barriers.

Further opportunities are emerging in peptide-based oncology treatments, specialized therapies for chronic and rare conditions, and manufacturing partnerships designed to improve production capacity and supply reliability.

